DESCRIPTION:Flame Monroe – An explosive and inspiring talent hailing from
  Chicago\, Flame Monroe is an Emmy nominated comedian\, host\, actor and fe
 male impersonator. Flame’s introduction to audiences in the United States
  and abroad has been anything but traditional. Flame’s dynamic sense of s
 tyle\, flair\, and storytelling has earned her spots on HBO’s Def Comedy 
 Jam\, BET’s Comicview and a feature in Tiffany Haddish Presents: They Rea
 dy on Netflix. The energetic\, hilarious and informative half-hour comedy r
 outine touches on all things Flame Monroe: her past\, her politics\, her fa
 mily and how she shows no signs of slowing down in her stilettos. With more
  than two decades on stages across the country honing her art\, Flame’s m
 ost challenging\, yet rewarding\, role has been that of single-parent to th
 ree academically gifted and creative children.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 
